  "albumInformation": "<p>With songs like \"Bona's Psychedelic\nBreakfast\" and \"Beatle Suit and Purple Boots,\" this Mexico City 5-piece paid fuzzy,\nblissful tribute to mods and kraut-rockers alike. Be sure to check out\ntheir most recent album, <i>Nevergreens: Vol. 1</i>, released on their label, <a href=\"http://www.siliconcarne.com.mx/\">Silicon Carne</a>, which has also put out albums by Stereo Total and Dungen. There's a video of their single, \"Ja Ja Ja,\" up on <a href=\"http://myspacetv.com/index.cfm?fuseaction=vids.individual&amp;videoid=26129337\">their myspace page</a>. -Jen V<br /></p>",
